# Cloudflare: a share link /r/<code> or /c/<code> opened in a browser goes to the share page with the
# code in the address (/r/?t=<code>), which the page already reads. In the iPhone app the link opens
# the app directly, so this only matters in a browser.
# (Cloudflare refuses "rewrite to index.html" rules here as a possible loop, so this is a redirect.)
/r/:code /r/?t=:code 302
/c/:code /c/?t=:code 302
